  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
